 | PUT | `/items/{id}` | Partial update (`exclude_unset`); same 404/403 ownership rules as GET. |
 | DELETE | `/items/{id}` | Same ownership rules. |
+| POST | `/items/{id}/archive` | Soft-delete the item; same ownership rules. |
+| POST | `/items/{id}/unarchive` | Restore the item; same ownership rules. |
 
